# Rendered page images ARE committed. `next.config.ts` traces them into the
# function bundle, and Vercel builds from this repo, so a gitignored image is an
# image the deployed reader cannot serve. Safe only while this repo is PRIVATE —
# if it is ever made public, this line must come back first.
# content/pages/
